OL,5,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FExperienced hotelier Gez hosts at
OL,7,     FThe Thomas Paine Hotel in
OL,8,     FThetford. Sarah and Chris make a
OL,9,     Fsaucy discovery and competitive
OL,10,     Fspirits are unleashed during a
OL,11,     FHome Guard training exercise.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FChris and Sarah hope that the
OL,14,     Ffactory next door won't detract
OL,15,     Ffrom the charms of their historic
OL,16,     Fpub, the Rose and Crown in Tenbury
OL,17,     FWells. But Gez takes exception to
OL,18,     Fthe setting.
